   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Menopause: where is she in the transition, and can she take menopausal hormone therapy (MHT) for her symptom?",
   "lines": [
    "history: last menstrual period (LMP) · hot flashes, sleep, mood, genitourinary, libido · a blood clot or breast cancer?",
    "abnormal or post-menopausal bleeding: see the ABNORMAL BLEEDING chart · bone: see the OSTEOPOROSIS chart"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_stage",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 158,
   "w": 924,
   "h": 114,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "WHERE IS SHE? set by her AGE and her LAST PERIOD",
   "lines": [
    "the same symptoms at every stage; the periods are what differ"
   ]
  },
  {
